1 evidence log committed               guard exit 1   names casting-1-demo.log: yes
2 rm, deletion NOT committed           guard exit 1   names casting-1-demo.log: yes
3 deletion committed                   guard exit 0   names casting-1-demo.log: no
4 baseline-carried log stripped        guard exit 0   names casting-1-demo.log: no
